                                                "sense_id": "1431f333-ab0a-3b22-8ac7-dba7ec0aff12",
                                                "text": "Kadara was of great interest to the Andromeda Initiative after it appeared on long-range surveys. Seemingly abundant liquid water and an oxygen-mix atmosphere made it a strong candidate for settlement, earning it the designation Habitat 4. Closer range surveys now reveal that Kadara's water sources are tainted and unpotable."
                                            }
